<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ ADRs mixed in late N.Y., Dow dips 29 points.</title>
<headline>NZ ADRs mixed in late N.Y., Dow dips 29 points.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were mixed in afternoon New York trade, where the Dow Industrials had lost 31.17 points to 6,781.92 by 8 a.m. NZT.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S., Britain and Australia.</p>
<p>Company	 Exchange  Last	    Net change</p>
<p>Tranz Rail     N.Y.    US$16 1/4	 +0 1/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$32		 nil  *</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$28 5/8	 -0 7/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Paper	N.Y.    US$19 5/8	 -0 1/4 *</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$15	     +0 1/8 *</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$80 3/8	 -0 1/2 *</p>
<p>Evergreen	N.Y.    untraded</p>
<p>Thistle	  London  190		 - 0 1/2</p>
<p>Guinness Peat  London  33		  - 0 1/2</p>
<p>Brierley	 London  untraded</p>
<p>NZ IT	    London  254		 -+ 1</p>
<p>Foreign &amp; Col  London  151 1/4	   -0 1/2</p>
<p>Templeton	London  154		 -0 1/4</p>
<p>Lion	     Sydney  A$3.35		+5</p>
<p>Goodman	  Sydney  A$1.58		-2</p>
<p>Macraes	  Sydney  A$2.70		+5</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of 16 shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>- Asterisk * means stock is still trading</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
